  "question": "A charged particle having drift velocity of $7.5 \\times 10^{-4}\\ \\text{m s}^{-1}$ in an electric field of $3 \\times 10^{-10}\\ \\text{V m}^{-1}$, has a mobility in $\\text{m}^2\\text{V}^{-1}\\text{s}^{-1}$ of :",
